 "Temporary password": "Iphasiwedi yesikhashana",
 "Save and continue": "Londoloza uqhubeke",
 "Your administrator gave you a temporary password. Choose your own to continue.": "Umlawuli wakho ukunikeze iphasiwedi yesikhashana. Khetha eyakho ukuze uqhubeke.",
 "Have an account?": "Usunayo i-akhawunti?",
 "Changes apply instantly and are saved to your account.": "Izinguquko zisebenza ngokushesha futhi zilondolozwa ku-akhawunti yakho.",
