 "Colour-blind safe colours": "Imibala ephephile kwabangaboni imibala",
 "Uses blue and orange for status colours": "Isebenzisa okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka nokuwolintshi kwemibala yesimo",
 "Reading guide": "Umhlahlandlela wokufunda",
 "Highlights the line you are reading and dims the rest": "Igqamisa umugqa owufundayo bese ifiphaza okunye",
 "Movement & layout": "Ukunyakaza nokwakheka",
 "Reduce motion": "Nciphisa ukunyakaza",
 "Turns off animations and moving backgrounds": "Icisha opopayi nezizinda ezinyakazayo",
 "Larger buttons": "Izinkinobho ezinkulu",
 "Makes buttons and links bigger and easier to press": "Yenza izinkinobho nezixhumanisi zibe zinkulu futhi kube lula ukuzicindezela",
 "Easy-read mode": "Imodi yokufunda okulula",
 "Simpler pages with less on screen and a short guide at the top": "Amakhasi alula anezinto ezimbalwa esikrinini nomhlahlandlela omfushane phezulu",
 "Listening & speaking": "Ukulalela nokukhuluma",
 "Read Cammy's replies aloud": "Funda izimpendulo zikaCammy ngokuzwakalayo",
 "Cammy speaks each answer automatically": "UCammy ukhuluma yonke impendulo ngokuzenzakalelayo",
 "Reading speed": "Ijubane lokufunda",
 "Slow": "Kancane",
 "Normal": "Okujwayelekile",
 "Fast": "Ngokushesha",
 "Faster": "Ngokushesha kakhulu",
 "Read aloud is not supported in this browser.": "Ukufunda ngokuzwakalayo akusekelwa kulesi siphequluli.",
 "Voice input: press the microphone in any message box to dictate.": "Ukufaka ngezwi: cindezela imakrofoni kunoma iliphi ibhokisi lomlayezo ukuze ukhulume.",
 "Voice input needs Chrome or Edge.": "Ukufaka ngezwi kudinga i-Chrome noma i-Edge.",
 "Keyboard & support": "Ikhibhodi nokwesekwa",
 "Close": "Vala",
 "Shortcuts work anywhere except while you are typing in a field.": "Izinqamuleli zisebenza noma kuphi ngaphandle kwalapho uthayipha enkundleni.",
 "Show this help": "Bonisa lolu sizo",
